  "facts": [
    "The General Artigas Bridge, a cantilever marvel, stretches 2,350 metres across the Uruguay River, boasting a 140‑metre main span that links Argentina and Uruguay.",
    "Inaugurated on December 10, 1975, the bridge honors José Gervasio Artigas, Uruguay’s independence father, cementing a symbolic cross‑border connection.",
